+golden-heart-pendant-dulha-haar,Golden Heart Pendant Tiered Pearl Dulha Haar / गोल्डन हार्ट लटकन बहुस्तरीय मोती दूल्हा हार,"<p><strong>4-tier layered pearl garland adorned with gold heart pendants | सुनहरे हार्ट पेंडेंट से सुसज्जित 4-लड़ी मोती दूल्हा हार</strong></p><p>Multi-tiered layered groom necklace featuring four cascading pearl strands accented with golden ball beads, each lower tier embellished with an ornate hanging gold heart-shaped pendant with pearl centre inlay.</p><p><em>बहुस्तरीय दूल्हा हार, जिसमें प्रत्येक लड़ी पर सुंदर सुनहरे हार्ट पेंडेंट और श्वेत मोती जड़े हैं।</em></p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>Unique heart-shaped golden drop pendants on each layer</li><li>Evenly spaced white pearls and gold metal beads</li><li>Symmetrical cascade creating balanced groom necklines</li><li>Packaged on traditional groom display card</li></ul>",BHAYA INDIA,Home & Living > Religious & Ceremonial > Garlands,Groom Garland,"garlands, groom-garland, featured, bhaya-india, real-products, handcrafted",false,Title,Default Title,BI-DG-002,250,shopify,,deny,manual,,true,true,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0753/3507/3885/files/dulha-haar-golden-heart-pendant.jpg?v=1792063036,1,Golden Heart Pendant Tiered Pearl Dulha Haar — Bhaya India,Unique 4-tier pearl groom garland with cascading gold heart pendants from Bhaya India.,draft
+multi-tier-pearl-ruby-brooch-dulha-haar,Multi-Tier Pearl Dulha Haar with Side Ruby Brooch / मल्टी-लेयर मोती व रूबी ब्रोच दूल्हा हार,"<p><strong>5-tier draped pearl garland with cylindrical gold beads & ruby brooch | 5-लड़ी मोती हार, सुनहरे बेलनाकार मोती व रूबी ब्रोच के साथ</strong></p><p>5-tier draped groom necklace with lustrous white pearls, cylindrical textured gold spacer barrels, and an ornate circular crystal brooch with oval red centre stone.</p><p><em>5-लड़ी भव्य दूल्हा हार, बारीक नक्काशीदार सुनहरे बेलनाकार बीड्स और लाल स्टोन वाले गोलाकार क्रिस्टल ब्रोच के साथ।</em></p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>Extensive 5-strand graduated pearl cascade for royal volume</li><li>Textured cylindrical gold barrel spacers</li><li>Side crystal brooch providing royal focal point</li><li>Mounted on 'ABC दुल्हा हार' display card</li></ul>",BHAYA INDIA,Home & Living > Religious & Ceremonial > Garlands,Groom Garland,"garlands, groom-garland, featured, bhaya-india, real-products, handcrafted",false,Title,Default Title,BI-DG-003,250,shopify,,deny,manual,,true,true,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0753/3507/3885/files/dulha-haar-multi-tier-pearl-ruby.jpg?v=1792063040,1,Multi-Tier Pearl Dulha Haar with Ruby Brooch — Bhaya India,Royal 5-tier pearl groom garland with cylindrical gold spacers and ruby brooch from Bhaya India.,draft
+premium-banarasi-silk-saree,Premium Banarasi Silk Saree / प्रीमियम बनारसी सिल्क साड़ी,"<p><strong>Heritage weave, contemporary grace | विरासती बुनाई, समकालीन लालित्य</strong></p><p>Handwoven Banarasi silk saree crafted with genuine gold-tone zari embellishment along the borders and ornate pallu. Blends timeless Indian craftsmanship with modern refinement, ideal for weddings, family milestones, and auspicious celebrations.</p><p><em>हथकरघे पर निर्मित प्रामाणिक बनारसी सिल्क साड़ी, पारंपरिक जरी बॉर्डर और समृद्ध पल्लू के साथ। विवाह एवं शुभ अवसरों के लिए सर्वोत्कृष्ट भारतीय शिल्प।</em></p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>Pure mulberry silk foundation</li><li>Authentic Banarasi Kadhwa weave</li><li>Rich zari borders and heavy ornamental pallu</li><li>Silk Mark certified quality assurance</li></ul>",BHAYA INDIA,Home & Living > Religious & Ceremonial > Garlands,Textiles & Fabrics,"garlands, textiles-fabrics, featured, bhaya-india, real-products, handcrafted",false,Title,Default Title,BI-TX-001,250,shopify,,deny,manual,,true,true,/assets/category-textiles.jpg,1,Premium Banarasi Silk Saree — Bhaya India,Authentic handwoven Banarasi pure silk saree with zari border. Pan-India delivery from Bhaya India.,draft
+leather-bound-executive-notebook,Leather-Bound Executive Notebook / प्रीमियम लेदर-बाउंड एग्जीक्यूटिव नोटबुक,"<p><strong>Write your legacy with intention | अपने विचारों को दें एक गरिमापूर्ण रूप</strong></p><p>Handcrafted top-grain leather journal with 200 pages of 90 GSM archival-grade ivory paper. Featuring lay-flat bookbinding, gilded edge accents, and a satin bookmark ribbon. Built for leaders, thinkers, and discerning professionals.</p><p><em>हस्तनिर्मित टॉप-ग्रेन लेदर कवर और 90 जीएसएम एसिड-फ्री आइवरी पेपर्स के साथ निर्मित जर्नल। विचारकों, कॉर्पोरेट लीडर्स और रचनाकारों के लिए उत्कृष्ट साथी।</em></p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>Supple genuine leather finish that patinas with age</li><li>Zero bleed-through on fountain pens and rollers</li><li>Integrated dual bookmark ribbons</li><li>Custom hot-foil gold monogramming available on bulk orders</li></ul>",BHAYA INDIA,Home & Living > Religious & Ceremonial > Garlands,Stationery & Office,"garlands, stationery-office, featured, bhaya-india, real-products, handcrafted",false,Title,Default Title,BI-ST-002,250,shopify,,deny,manual,,true,true,/assets/category-stationery.jpg,1,Leather-Bound Executive Notebook — Bhaya India,Fine genuine leather notebook with archival paper. Shop luxury office stationery at Bhaya India.,draft
+royal-heritage-festival-hamper,Royal Heritage Festival Hamper / रॉयल हेरिटेज त्योहार उपहार,"<p><strong>Thoughtful gifting made effortless | विचारशील उपहार, अत्यंत सहजता के साथ</strong></p><p>An opulent gift trunk handcrafted in wooden casing with gold-embossed faux leather trim. Includes artisanal saffron treats, stone-ground dry fruits, pure brass incense holder, hand-poured soy candle, and personalized greeting scroll.</p><p><em>त्योहारों, शादियों और कॉर्पोरेट आयोजनों के लिए विशेष रूप से तैयार किया गया प्रीमियम हैंपर — जिसमें पारंपरिक मिष्ठान, उत्कृष्ट स्टेशनरी और हस्तनिर्मित वस्तुएं शामिल हैं।</em></p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>Curated assortment of premium dry fruits and sweets</li><li>Brass handcrafted artifact for lasting keepsake</li><li>Custom foil-stamped corporate company ribbon option</li><li>Express temperature-controlled shipping</li></ul>",BHAYA INDIA,Home & Living > Religious & Ceremonial > Garlands,Gift Hampers,"garlands, gift-hampers, featured, bhaya-india, real-products, handcrafted",false,Title,Default Title,BI-GH-003,250,shopify,,deny,manual,,true,true,/assets/hero-editorial.jpg,1,Royal Heritage Festival Hamper — Bhaya India,Luxury corporate and festive gifting hampers by Bhaya India. Nationwide delivery.,draft
+handcrafted-brass-urli-bowl,Handcrafted Brass Urli Bowl / हस्तनिर्मित पीतल उरली बाउल,"<p><strong>Spiritual serenity in pure metal | शुद्ध धातु में आध्यात्मिक शांति</strong></p><p>Traditional bell-metal brass urli bowl hand-beaten by hereditary artisans. Perfectly sized for floating flower petals, aromatic water, and tealights at the entrance of homes and luxury office receptions.</p><p><em>पारंपरिक कारीगरों द्वारा हस्तनिर्मित शुद्ध पीतल की उरली। घर के प्रवेश द्वार और स्वागत कक्ष में फूलों की पंखुड़ियों, सुगंधित जल और दीपकों के लिए उपयुक्त।</em></p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>Hand-carved floral edge filigree</li><li>Heavy stable base prevents tipping</li><li>Coated with natural tarnish-resistant lacquer</li></ul>",BHAYA INDIA,Home & Living > Religious & Ceremonial > Garlands,Home & Living,"garlands, home-living, featured, bhaya-india, real-products, handcrafted",false,Title,Default Title,BI-HL-004,250,shopify,,deny,manual,,true,true,/assets/hero-editorial.jpg,1,Handcrafted Brass Urli Bowl — Bhaya India Home,Pure brass hand-carved urli bowl for floating flowers. Buy authentic home decor at Bhaya India.,draft
+chanderi-silk-cotton-dupatta,Chanderi Silk Cotton Dupatta / चंदेरी सिल्क कॉटन दुपट्टा,"<p><strong>Breezy elegance woven with grace | शालीनता और सहज आकर्षण का सुंदर संगम</strong></p><p>Lightweight authentic Chanderi fabric combining raw silk warp with fine combed cotton weft. Embellished with delicate hand-block gold motifs (boota) and sheer pallu detailing.</p><p><em>हल्का प्रामाणिक चंदेरी कपड़ा, जिसमें शुद्ध सिल्क और कॉटन का सुंदर मिश्रण है। पारंपरिक सुनहरी बूटा कढ़ाई और किनारी के साथ सुसज्जित।</em></p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>Authentic Madhya Pradesh Chanderi cluster weave</li><li>Zari tissue borders</li><li>Subtle shimmer in natural daylight</li></ul>",BHAYA INDIA,Home & Living > Religious & Ceremonial > Garlands,Textiles & Fabrics,"garlands, textiles-fabrics, featured, bhaya-india, real-products, handcrafted",false,Title,Default Title,BI-TX-005,250,shopify,,deny,manual,,true,true,/assets/category-textiles.jpg,1,Chanderi Silk Cotton Dupatta — Bhaya India,Authentic handwoven Chanderi dupatta with gold boota motifs. Bhaya India textiles.,draft
+institutional-bulk-uniform-fabric,Institutional Bulk Uniform Fabric / संस्थागत थोक यूनिफॉर्म कपड़ा,"<p><strong>Industrial durability meets comfort | औद्योगिक मजबूती और संपूर्ण आराम</strong></p><p>High-density poly-viscose and combed cotton blended textiles tailored for institutional uniforms, corporate workforce attire, and hospitality garments. Available in roll bolts of 50m to 500m.</p><p><em>संस्थानों, कार्यस्थलों और कॉर्पोरेट यूनिफॉर्म के लिए विशेष रूप से तैयार किया गया उच्च-घनत्व पॉली-विस्कोस कपड़ा। 50 से 500 मीटर के थानों में उपलब्ध।</em></p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>Wrinkle-resistant and sweat-wicking breathability</li><li>Tested for 100+ commercial wash cycles</li><li>Custom Pantone dyeing available for 500m+ orders</li></ul>",BHAYA INDIA,Home & Living > Religious & Ceremonial > Garlands,Wholesale & Bulk,"garlands, wholesale-bulk, featured, bhaya-india, real-products, handcrafted",false,Title,Default Title,BI-WB-006,250,shopify,,deny,manual,,true,true,/assets/category-textiles.jpg,1,Institutional Bulk Uniform Fabric — Bhaya India Wholesale,Commercial and institutional uniform textiles in bulk rolls. Request quotation from Bhaya India.,draft
